{"strongs": "H4270", "word": "מַחְסוֺר", "translit": "mach.sor", "root": "מחסור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "need, thing needed, poverty", "definition": "מַחְסוֺר , מַחְסֹר noun [masculine] need, thing needed, poverty ; — ׳ מ absolute Prov 11:24 + 6 t.; construct Judg 18:10 ; Judg 19:19 suffix מַחְסוֺרְךָ Judg 19:20 מַחְסרְךָ Prov 6:11 מַחְסֹרוֺ Deut 15:8 plural suffix מַחְסֹרֶיךָ Prov 24:34 — 1. need = thing needed דֵּי מַחְסֹרוֺ Deut 15:8 enough for his need (followed by אשׁר יֶחְסַר לוֺ , compare חָסֵר verb); עָלָ֑י ׳ כָּלמֿ Judg 19:20 all thy need be upon me (for me to provide). 2. lack, want כָּלדָּֿבָר ׳ אֵין מ Judg 18:10 no lack of anything , Judg 19:19 ; Ps 34:10 . 3. in general, need, poverty Prov 6:11 (|| רֵאשׁ ) = Prov 24:34 (|| רֵישׁ ), Prov 11:24 ; Prov 14:23 ; Prov 21:5 ; Prov 22:16 ; Prov 28:27 ׳ אִישׁ מ Prov 21:17 a man of poverty . חַף see II. חפף .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2992')\">BDB2992</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4270')\">H4270</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2991')\">BDB2991</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2993')\">BDB2993</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַחְסוֺר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מַחְסֹר</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>need, thing needed, poverty</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Prov 11:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,24)\">Prov 11:24</ref> + 6 t.; construct <ref ref=\"Judg 18:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,10)\">Judg 18:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 19:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,19)\">Judg 19:19</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מַחְסוֺרְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 19:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,20)\">Judg 19:20</ref> <bdbheb>מַחְסרְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:11\" b=\"20\" c